العيادات الخارجية  |  Oncology Center
(لا يوجد وصف عربي على الموقع)
An integrated medical institution that provides comprehensive diagnosis and treatment for cancer patients, using the latest technologies and devices (chemotherapy, radiotherapy, and immunotherapy), and a specialized multidisciplinary medical team (surgery, internal medicine, physical therapy), with a focus on the psychological and social care of the patient. It includes services from early detection to final care, and offers its services for free at times (such as the National Cancer Institute) or at a cost (private centers), while striving to improve the quality of life of patients and increase the chances of recovery.
